{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":20,"ref":"jeremiah 49:20","book":"jeremiah","lang":"jv","chapter":49,"translation":"Mulane padha nglentothokna parentahé Yahweh sing wis didhawuhaké marang Edom, lan pikiran-pikirané sing wis dipikiraké marang para penggonan ing Teman: Yèn ta isih ana sing cilik ing kéwan-kébo sing bisa ngrénggèni wong-wong mau — yèn ta isih ana sing bisa nglantarana papan panggonané ing sandhuwuring wong-wong mau!","tokens":[{"surface":"לכן","gloss":"mulane"},{"surface":"שמעו","gloss":"padha nglentothokna"},{"surface":"עצת","gloss":"parentahé"},{"surface":"יהוה","gloss":"Yahweh"},{"surface":"אשר","gloss":"sing"},{"surface":"יעץ","gloss":"wis didhawuhaké"},{"surface":"אל","gloss":"marang"},{"surface":"אדום","gloss":"Edom"},{"surface":"ומחשבותיו","gloss":"lan pikiran-pikirané"},{"surface":"אשר","gloss":"sing"},{"surface":"חשב","gloss":"wis dipikiraké"},{"surface":"אל","gloss":"marang"},{"surface":"ישבי","gloss":"para penggonan ing"},{"surface":"תימן","gloss":"Teman"},{"surface":"אם","gloss":"yèn"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"ora"},{"surface":"יסחבום","gloss":"bisa ngrénggèni wong-wong mau"},{"surface":"צעירי","gloss":"sing cilik ing"},{"surface":"הצאן","gloss":"kéwan-kébo"},{"surface":"אם","gloss":"yèn"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"ora"},{"surface":"ישים","gloss":"bisa nglantarana"},{"surface":"עליהם","gloss":"ing sandhuwuring wong-wong mau"},{"surface":"נוהם","gloss":"papan panggonané"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-21T01:05:04.022860679Z","model":"glm-5.3"}